    "markdown": "## 맵 아이콘 인터그래이션\n### 0.1.3 Change Log\n#### Global\n##### Fixed\n* Fixed stale NPC edits overwriting newer settings when saving map profiles.\n##### Improved\n* Improved NPC synchronization for players sharing the same dimension.\n* Improved image caching and JourneyMap updates for unchanged icons.\n#### Forge 1.20.1 / Fabric & NeoForge 1.21.1\n##### Fixed\n* Fixed JourneyMap icons disappearing after replacing textures under the same resource ID.\n#### Forge 1.20.1\n##### Fixed\n* Fixed DNPC map icons remaining hidden on Forge.\n* Fixed unrestricted DRM dependencies being rejected on Forge.\n",
    "html": "<h3>0.1.3 Change Log</h3>\n<h4>Global</h4>\n<h5>Fixed</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed stale NPC edits overwriting newer settings when saving map profiles.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>Improved</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>Improved NPC synchronization for players sharing the same dimension.</li>\n<li>Improved image caching and JourneyMap updates for unchanged icons.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Forge 1.20.1 / Fabric &amp; NeoForge 1.21.1</h4>\n<h5>Fixed</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed JourneyMap icons disappearing after replacing textures under the same resource ID.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Forge 1.20.1</h4>\n<h5>Fixed</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed DNPC map icons remaining hidden on Forge.</li>\n<li>Fixed unrestricted DRM dependencies being rejected on Forge.</li>\n</ul>\n"
  }
